<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="vbvd6" id="vbvd6" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u761ab4d9" id="u761ab4d9">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="ueb12dd29" id="ueb12dd29"> 𝐎𝐧-𝐏𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐲 𝐃𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐥𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐨𝐟 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬: 𝐋𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐟𝐫𝐨𝐦 𝐒𝐞𝐥𝐟-𝐆𝐞𝐧𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐌𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐤𝐞𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u0f4fd34a" id="u0f4fd34a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0880f384" id="u0880f384">以语言模型为代表的自回归序列模型已在众多任务中展现出卓越的能力，其成功往往得益于训练数据规模与模型参数量的扩大。然而，增加参数量也会带来相应的成本，使此类模型的部署受到推理开销或内存占用的限制。因此，推动高性能大模型实际应用的一项关键目标，是在尽可能保留模型性能的前提下，通过减少参数量实现模型压缩</span></strong></p><ul list="u5cced049"><li fid="ubf728c50" data-lake-id="uecad5f8a" id="uecad5f8a"><span data-lake-id="ud676a6a3" id="ud676a6a3">知识蒸馏是一种广泛应用的模型压缩技术。蒸馏是指在特定任务集合上训练一个模型——学生模型，使其学习并复现另一个模型——教师模型所掌握的知识。通常，学生模型的参数量小于教师模型，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u11da2974" id="u11da2974" style="color: #DF2A3F">蒸馏能够提升学生模型在特定任务上的性能，同时使其推理开销和内存占用保持在低于教师模型的水平</span></strong></li><li fid="ubf728c50" data-lake-id="uc934bf8f" id="uc934bf8f"><span data-lake-id="u834af116" id="u834af116">现有针对自回归序列模型的蒸馏方法，或者需要由教师模型生成一组固定的输出序列，这一过程可能具有较高的计算成本；或者依赖固定的序列数据集，由教师模型为其提供词元级概率标签。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u19b1894d" id="u19b1894d" style="color: #DF2A3F">然而，使用固定数据集可能导致训练阶段所见的输出序列与学生模型在推理阶段自回归生成的序列之间出现分布失配，这也是模仿学习领域的一个已知问题</span></strong></li><li fid="ubf728c50" data-lake-id="u60ce3986" id="u60ce3986"><span data-lake-id="u88951423" id="u88951423">常用的蒸馏目标是最小化教师分布与学生分布之间的前向 KL 散度。但学生模型的表达能力可能不足以拟合教师分布，从而生成一些教师模型不太可能生成的样本</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue58af4c4" id="ue58af4c4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u62452e5f" id="u62452e5f" style="color: #5C0036">本文提出广义知识蒸馏，以缓解上述问题。首先自回归序列模型的知识蒸馏可以被视为一个具有交互式专家的模仿学习问题。基于这一认识，GKD 在学生模型自身生成的同策略序列上进行训练，而非使用固定的输出序列集合，并将教师模型在这些序列上给出的概率分布作为专家监督标签</span></strong></p><ul list="u4b1f1d54"><li fid="u032b212a" data-lake-id="u227eb4f6" id="u227eb4f6"><span data-lake-id="udee73e31" id="udee73e31">近期利用大语言模型自身生成的输出序列进行微调所取得的成功，也进一步支持这一思路。此外，GKD 支持灵活选用其他散度度量，例如反向 KL 散度与广义 Jensen–Shannon 散度，使学生模型能够利用有限的模型容量，专注于生成在教师分布下具有较高概率的样本</span></li><li fid="u032b212a" data-lake-id="u25780419" id="u25780419"><span data-lake-id="u13584440" id="u13584440">GKD 将部分已有的自回归语言模型蒸馏方法纳入统一框架，同时构建新的同策略蒸馏方法，其性能显著优于常用方法</span></li></ul><ul list="u67aac8e2"><li fid="ube91b060" data-lake-id="u8eaf5476" id="u8eaf5476"><span data-lake-id="u3f844ed5" id="u3f844ed5">针对自回归语言模型在训练与推理阶段的分布差异，提出 GKD，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u10231340" id="u10231340" style="color: #004347">在教师模型词元级概率分布的指导下，利用学生模型生成的同策略输出序列进行蒸馏</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8d79ec0d" id="u8d79ec0d">。在任务特定蒸馏和任务无关蒸馏中，GKD 均显著优于常用方法</span></li><li fid="ube91b060" data-lake-id="u5fcacd2e" id="u5fcacd2e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud2b93fd4" id="ud2b93fd4" style="color: #004347">同策略 GKD 能够与语言模型的强化学习微调自然结合，而这种联合方式此前尚未得到探索。在蒸馏过程中使用学生模型生成的同策略输出序列具有重要作用，而教师模型与学生模型之间最优散度的选择具有任务依赖性</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="yYaGn" id="yYaGn" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u051df82a" id="u051df82a">🌊</span><span data-lake-id="ud586a5b7" id="ud586a5b7" style="color: #004347"> </span><span data-lake-id="udd3697c2" id="udd3697c2">𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ucffb2456" id="ucffb2456"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8bff58ca" id="u8bff58ca">自回归生成根据此前已生成的词元，逐个预测后续词元。第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yYCMO%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue3854776" id="ue3854776">个词元</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F81583f6ae4f015e37fafa82ea407fe1c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zCQ9C%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u971686c9" id="u971686c9">的预测概率</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(y_n%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5acae5aab89cb4231a28c72adb33dba3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f6le6%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u06474557" id="u06474557">通过带有温度参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4aa418d6f0b6fbada90489b4374752e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T732G%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u47c8597c" id="u47c8597c">的 softmax 函数计算</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ucc580c2a" id="ucc580c2a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(y_n%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cexp(z_n%2F%5C%5Cgamma)%7D%5Cn%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BM%7D%5C%5Cexp(z_i%2F%5C%5Cgamma)%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3cbf881ea70604d8cdc7a900855facee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RQD9p%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uae6ad712"><li fid="ue2043cba" data-lake-id="u42c0b70f" id="u42c0b70f"><span data-lake-id="u6e3c6280" id="u6e3c6280">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb110f53c5696fc3f49684ac5018a3a15.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hlh07%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua164aa9d" id="ua164aa9d">为词元</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F81583f6ae4f015e37fafa82ea407fe1c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VuWHl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc5fec3a2" id="uc5fec3a2">对应的 logit 分数。较高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4aa418d6f0b6fbada90489b4374752e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KH69Y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uacf81c15" id="uacf81c15">会增加生成的随机性，而较低的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4aa418d6f0b6fbada90489b4374752e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K3xZS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5c01f246" id="u5c01f246">则更倾向于选择概率最高的词，使输出更加确定。训练期间，学生模型的温度固定为 1。评估时，采用贪心采样或温度采样</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4671aecf" id="u4671aecf"><strong><span data-lake-id="u42ba2f61" id="u42ba2f61">基于 KL 的散度：散度用于衡量两个概率分布的相似程度，其中 KL 散度是一种广泛使用的度量。两个离散分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P(C)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9c7a32f5e819dc766ae970f3866e7fbf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D0h6J%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u52caab82" id="u52caab82">与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q(C)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fced65b7140aa2f8f2465339c91af6f1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hGPIb%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6a0e4951" id="u6a0e4951">之间的 KL 散度定义为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u0fe566f8" id="u0fe566f8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(P%5C%5C%7CQ)%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bc%5C%5Cin%20C%7D%5CnP(c)%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7BP(c)%7D%7BQ(c)%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffbafa8931a8714bd7e0cdfdbd5ee68c4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rZzFx%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u295d9bae"><li fid="ub79ee936" data-lake-id="ub6dff693" id="ub6dff693"><span data-lake-id="u8874fddc" id="u8874fddc">KL 散度不具有对称性，即通常有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(P%5C%5C%7CQ)%5Cn%5C%5Cneq%5CnD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(Q%5C%5C%7CP).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9ceddb4edf5dda1af7573cfdfa35422.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zAIhU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6b45b30e" id="u6b45b30e">因此，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(P%5C%5C%7CQ)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe139dcf5d762f1d51c661f05252c9647.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hHXza%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4457f7b0" id="u4457f7b0">称为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fffd1905f6d4d60accedfa6b91be93ea9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bUD1W%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u742fbbe9" id="u742fbbe9">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ef7132d0df72d9e3db76f6391960a3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tsvtm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u482029b9" id="u482029b9">之间的前向 KL 散度，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(Q%5C%5C%7CP)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc373d90b746abc531dc03d6578a6576d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U6dv1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u367d6b87" id="u367d6b87">称为反向 KL 散度。当目标分布为经验数据分布时，最小化前向 KL 对应于监督学习中所采用的最大似然优化</span></li><li fid="ub79ee936" data-lake-id="uf4173766" id="uf4173766"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ca0da14" id="u5ca0da14">在模型容量不匹配的情况下，利用分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q_%5C%5Ctheta(C)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbfb54498a944c89b10d34714002380a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nLXZo%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1afeeb28" id="u1afeeb28">逼近</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P(C)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9c7a32f5e819dc766ae970f3866e7fbf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mQ0v0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9e4b22ac" id="u9e4b22ac">时，最小化反向 KL 与前向 KL 会产生均值寻优与模式寻优的行为</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua5d89cb4" id="ua5d89cb4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u868071ea" id="u868071ea">KL 散度可能无界，而广义 Jensen–Shannon 散度（JSD）是一种具有上界的常用散度，即使两个概率分布的支持集互不相交，它仍然保持有界。广义 JSD 通过满足</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220%3C%5C%5Cbeta%3C1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3ce211bb02fb4ecef6ba3d947afc5be3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Yz4UQ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u40474aa1" id="u40474aa1">的系数，在前向 KL 与反向 KL 之间进行插值</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub710e716" id="ub710e716" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5CnD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BJSD%7D(%5C%5Cbeta)%7D(P%5C%5C%7CQ)%5Cn%3D%7B%7D%26%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta%20D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5CnP%5Cn%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta%20P%2B(1-%5C%5Cbeta)Q%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%2B%5Cn(1-%5C%5Cbeta)D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5CnQ%5Cn%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta%20P%2B(1-%5C%5Cbeta)Q%5Cn%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1000df1cf44099c39e867f486bd6a9d9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Nh5yr%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u87e43dc2" id="u87e43dc2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clim_%7B%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cto%200%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7BD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BJSD%7D(%5C%5Cbeta)%7D(P%5C%5C%7CQ)%7D%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D%5Cn%3D%5CnD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(P%5C%5C%7CQ).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb9e6a7fef36856efaea823679d73167f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ex9XM%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud4aef9db"><li fid="u4be3176b" data-lake-id="ua4cd0902" id="ua4cd0902"><span data-lake-id="u3460fa29" id="u3460fa29">因此，当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6100158802e722a88c15efc101fc275b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iAyUz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u60af8c46" id="u60af8c46">分别接近 0 和 1 时，广义 JSD 的梯度行为分别与前向 KL 和反向 KL 相近</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="zdn2h" id="zdn2h" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u05809853" id="u05809853">🌸</span><span data-lake-id="u324f57be" id="u324f57be"> 𝐃𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐥𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐀𝐮𝐭𝐨-𝐑𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐬𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐒𝐞𝐪𝐮𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ueb969d40" id="ueb969d40"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1aad79f7" id="u1aad79f7">给定两个容量不同的自回归序列模型，分别用</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_S%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2c747aca89d6af9bed5805f1a90a093d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oiis7%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0138b737" id="u0138b737">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F24d6cc09c36e59d28e8dd7b8855bbc8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cdM44%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1777fb3f" id="u1777fb3f">表示学生模型与教师模型。假设学生模型具有可学习参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q7d34%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucff52934" id="ucff52934">，且</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_S%5E%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc34ec9e588e79874fd26fce5756caabe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bkcCU%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9558e2a9" id="u9558e2a9">关于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ezeFV%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uadddd211" id="uadddd211">可微。此外，给定输入数据集</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94e79ad0c1aabeafef9e2fc4af6adf66.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OLb9f%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="udd9401d5" id="udd9401d5">。还可以选择性地使用由输入–输出序列对组成的数据集</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(X%2CY)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5afcc2013e3d2621432e0de6093f7dff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U6WIL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc91a0d66" id="uc91a0d66">；若未提供该数据集，则可通过从教师模型中采样输出序列来构建</span></strong></p><ul list="uc49da758"><li fid="ua4527fc3" data-lake-id="ue261cbed" id="ue261cbed"><span data-lake-id="ueb899a84" id="ueb899a84">对于给定的输入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sjdFA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u02efedec" id="u02efedec">、输出序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cvCBC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2e477aa5" id="u2e477aa5">以及散度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F558270b7f0a90c3c286b860273d106a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HSY19%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u07606cc7" id="u07606cc7">，将教师模型与学生模型的词元级分布差异定义为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0e192ff9" id="u0e192ff9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D%5C%5Cleft(p_T%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7Cp_S%5E%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cright)(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5Cn%3A%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BL_y%7D%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bn%3D1%7D%5E%7BL_y%7D%5CnD%5C%5Cleft(%5Cnp_T(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20y_%7B%3Cn%7D%2Cx)%5Cn%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5Cnp_S%5E%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20y_%7B%3Cn%7D%2Cx)%5Cn%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa47f21a3aa09addf74f1240dc57bd5b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TAcN7%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ucac4c8c9" id="ucac4c8c9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BJSD%7D(%5C%5Cbeta)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(p_T%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7Cp_S%5E%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cright)(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BL_y%7D%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bn%3D1%7D%5E%7BL_y%7D%5CnD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BJSD%7D(%5C%5Cbeta)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cnp_T(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20y_%7B%3Cn%7D%2Cx)%5Cn%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5Cnp_S%5E%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20y_%7B%3Cn%7D%2Cx)%5Cn%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbd1ca16f6c12ad15fba7355ab04e6bbe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oTO3Q%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u78dfa611" id="u78dfa611"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1012012c" id="u1012012c">监督微调：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u02d97360" id="u02d97360">若仅给定包含真实标注输出序列的固定数据集，而无法查询教师策略，则一种简单的方法是最小化这些序列在学生策略下的负对数似然</span></p><p data-lake-id="ude2a9c05" id="ude2a9c05" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSFT%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7B(x%2Cy)%5C%5Csim(X%2CY)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn-%5C%5Clog%20p_S%5E%5C%5Ctheta(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ed50e4cc19f3a95d4714e552c34e08c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m01O2%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udbc45796" id="udbc45796"><strong><span data-lake-id="u12c2910a" id="u12c2910a">序列级知识蒸馏：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue2cc6bb9" id="ue2cc6bb9">序列级知识蒸馏最大化教师模型所生成的高概率序列在学生模型下的似然，因此可以视为在教师生成的输出上进行监督微调</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6ae257d6" id="u6ae257d6"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub37b6f05" id="ub37b6f05">监督式知识蒸馏：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u673b08df" id="u673b08df">监督式知识蒸馏是一种广泛使用的方法，通过训练学生模型来模仿教师模型的词元级概率分布。学生模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_S%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2c747aca89d6af9bed5805f1a90a093d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i1KrG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd83950b" id="ubd83950b">以教师模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_T%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F24d6cc09c36e59d28e8dd7b8855bbc8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XcN27%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf91fcee" id="ubf91fcee">的词元级概率分布为监督目标，该监督目标利用教师模型完整的词元级概率分布，从而提供丰富的训练信号</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4853e3db" id="u4853e3db" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BSD%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5Cn%3A%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7B(x%2Cy)%5C%5Csim(X%2CY)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5CnD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(p_T%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7Cp_S%5E%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cright)(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fec532499419316a818260cb55f15cba6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AcYov%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u0b9d9c22" id="u0b9d9c22"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5df65222" id="u5df65222" style="color: #664900">常用的知识蒸馏方法采用固定的输出序列数据集，其中的序列可以是真实标注，也可以由教师模型生成。然而，使用这些方法蒸馏自回归学生模型，会导致训练与推理阶段的分布失配。这是因为学生模型在推理阶段进行自回归生成时所遇到的部分序列，可能与训练阶段所见的序列存在较大差异。由于自回归模型每一步的预测均依赖此前的生成结果，这种失配可能产生级联效应：早期预测中的错误会影响后续预测，进而降低文本生成质量</span></strong></p><ul list="u69c056a4"><li fid="uc501e00f" data-lake-id="ud5e464d9" id="ud5e464d9"><span data-lake-id="u31e1f90b" id="u31e1f90b">为解决这一问题，主要借鉴模仿学习的思想。具体而言，同策略模仿学习方法迭代地使用学生策略收集序列，获取专家对这些序列的监督标签，再利用所得数据集重新训练学生模型</span></li><li fid="uc501e00f" data-lake-id="ub7c3163d" id="ub7c3163d"><span data-lake-id="u16b20a00" id="u16b20a00">将同策略模仿学习扩展至蒸馏，提出同策略知识蒸馏。在蒸馏过程中使用同策略数据时，学生模型能够通过教师模型的 logits，针对自身生成序列中的错误词元获得词元级反馈。这形成一种类似强化学习的反馈循环，有助于减小训练与推理阶段的分布失配。此外，随着学生模型在训练过程中不断改进，其生成数据的质量也随之提升。给定输入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HU5LL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue50d5dc1" id="ue50d5dc1">，学生模型生成输出序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sWJzd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u477d4164" id="u477d4164">，并在中间状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_%7B%3Cn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe61c05029898294ba2ec5795e8e16d45.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sPAod%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua63b7472" id="ua63b7472"> 上模仿教师模型的词元级分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_T(y_n%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F997897da7f2780feee296b3cfb954c00.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SoaYQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uad88d8a1" id="uad88d8a1">。具体而言，同策略损失</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BOD%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdce9283977e22c703cbc9c1b5d3786ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AqwN6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uec360be7" id="uec360be7">定义为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5ca82cb3" id="u5ca82cb3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BOD%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5Cn%3A%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%20X%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7By%5C%5Csim%20p_S(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5CnD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(p_T%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7Cp_S%5E%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cright)(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F75059d405afd7d04d47dfcb78e4bb183.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e9MZM%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1c1ecaad"><li fid="u76793d14" data-lake-id="uba654fa9" id="uba654fa9"><span data-lake-id="uf4574ad8" id="uf4574ad8">与同策略模仿学习类似，不通过学生模型的采样分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_S(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F560c020b6a5017c5418bda5a41630164.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f08Dm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9aa0ffd" id="ub9aa0ffd">反向传播梯度。不对采样过程进行反向传播，有助于保持训练的稳定性与计算效率。同策略知识蒸馏在学生模型较有可能生成的输出序列上进行训练。训练期间，使用温度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcfae9450fdf54b574831d26d4a0ad7f4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RCLLA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u417fc1ac" id="u417fc1ac">，以鼓励学生生成序列的多样性。此外，对于未标注的输入提示，由于学生模型的规模小于教师模型，使用学生模型生成序列的计算成本也更低</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u22072137" id="u22072137"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf0e71405" id="uf0e71405" style="color: #AD1A2B">在同策略知识蒸馏的基础上，进一步统一监督式方法与同策略方法，提出更一般的广义知识蒸馏。在 GKD 中，既可以选择优化的散度，也可以选择用于训练的输出序列。具体而言，可以优化教师模型与学生模型词元级概率分布之间的任意散度。在输出序列方面，GKD 混合使用固定数据集中的序列与学生模型生成的同策略序列，其中固定数据集既可以由教师生成，也可以包含真实标注。概括而言，GKD 最小化以下形式的目标函数</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u029de135" id="u029de135" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGKD%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5Cn%3A%3D%7B%7D%26%5Cn(1-%5C%5Clambda)%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7B(x%2Cy)%5C%5Csim(X%2CY)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5CnD%5C%5Cleft(p_T%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7Cp_S%5E%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cright)(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%2B%5Cn%5C%5Clambda%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%20X%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7By%5C%5Csim%20p_S(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5CnD%5C%5Cleft(p_T%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7Cp_S%5E%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cright)(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa8ea86b6ea731c79a0b61675eb079b46.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KGge0%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u68a210af"><li fid="u5d655c18" data-lake-id="u43ccb86d" id="u43ccb86d"><span data-lake-id="u770253c8" id="u770253c8">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D(p_T%2Cp_S)(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21d9722f8f008e734f2beb24d6011152.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jYUXV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf7557e6d" id="uf7557e6d">为教师分布与学生分布之间的散度；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0770581913249333ab149b6126c430d6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SrQqT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u20cc72ed" id="u20cc72ed">为控制学生数据占比的超参数，即学生模型生成的同策略输出在训练数据中所占的比例。与同策略知识蒸馏类似，不通过学生模型的采样过程反向传播梯度。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9b5bf8bd" id="u9b5bf8bd" style="color: #270070">当散度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F558270b7f0a90c3c286b860273d106a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uDyxR%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u164c96f6" id="u164c96f6" style="color: #270070">取前向 KL、学生数据占比</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe520c061a407db472027709bf3f73290.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YkKiy%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="udc9c918c" id="udc9c918c" style="color: #270070">分别取 1 和 0 时，GKD 分别退化为同策略知识蒸馏与监督式知识蒸馏。此外，GKD 允许采用其他数据占比</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe520c061a407db472027709bf3f73290.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UVLDV%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u266bac78" id="u266bac78" style="color: #270070">与散度组合</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7cc71111" id="u7cc71111"><span data-lake-id="uf760009f" id="uf760009f">尽管前向 KL 被广泛用于蒸馏，但它要求学生模型覆盖教师词元级分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_T(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20y_%7B%3Cn%7D%2Cx)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc8f88033bd684f8de190def758631e67.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PdJno%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u97eb5259" id="u97eb5259">的整个支持集。在这一过程中，学生模型最终可能向教师分布下概率较低的词元</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa770a282bbfa0ae1ec474b7ed311656d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xhHm6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3a4592fe" id="u3a4592fe">分配概率质量，从而产生幻觉和低质量输出。当学生模型的容量远低于教师模型时，采用温度采样更容易出现这一问题</span></p><p data-lake-id="u699ae1c2" id="u699ae1c2"><span data-lake-id="u10ea0e33" id="u10ea0e33">另一种选择是采用反向 KL 等具有模式寻优特性的散度。这类散度优先关注教师模型赋予较高概率的词元，有助于避免低质量生成，但代价是给定输入下的生成多样性降低。最优散度的选择似乎具有任务依赖性。总体而言，在选择 GKD 所使用的散度时，需要考虑特定任务中生成多样性与性能之间的权衡</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud34e694f" id="ud34e694f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1793414130761-1424422d-f602-45bc-b00e-f67a62b318c2.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ufb81d698-0353-44d6-9719-37fbe78e234%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u3617bca3-2723-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A953.6%2C%22height%22%3A349%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A180289%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1192%2C%22originHeight%22%3A436%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%220%3AUPDATE0TOMINIMIZELGKP%3A0-0-%E6%96%B92(GJEGVED(PLPS(YC)%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A359%2C%22width%22%3A923%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3AGIVEN%3ATEACHERMODELP%2CSTUDENTMODELPGDATASET(X%2CY)CONTAINING(INPUT%2COUTPUT)PAURS%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A1121%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLEINPUTSAFROMXANDGENERATEOUTPUTSYP(R)TOOBTAINB%3D%7B(TB%2CG)-%22%2C%22x%22%3A113%2C%22y%22%3A234%2C%22width%22%3A1028%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLEBATCHOFINPUTSANDOUTPUTSFROM(X%2CY)TOOBTAINB%3D(A%2CY%2C)-.%22%2C%22x%22%3A95%2C%22y%22%3A297%2C%22width%22%3A939%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3AHYPERPARAMETERS%3ASTUDENTDATAIRACTIONE0%2CLDIVERGENCED%2CLEAMUNGRATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A108%2C%22width%22%3A1009%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LGORITHM1GENERALIZEDKNOWLEDGEDISTILLATION(GKD)%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A694%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GENERATEARANDOMVALUEUMIFORM(0L)%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A171%2C%22width%22%3A595%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223%3AFOREACHSTEPKEL...KDO%22%2C%22x%22%3A26%2C%22y%22%3A140%2C%22width%22%3A410%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A150%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A195%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ILENDFOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A12%2C%22y%22%3A400%2C%22width%22%3A584%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IFU%3CATHEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A88%2C%22y%22%3A203%2C%22width%22%3A199%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ELSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A93%2C%22y%22%3A268%2C%22width%22%3A174%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A263%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A98%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f2f0%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua16bad41%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u35ce9680" id="u35ce9680"><span data-lake-id="ua2e6c4c1" id="ua2e6c4c1">在某些任务中，从教师模型进行蒸馏可能仅仅是实现主要目标的一种代理方式，而主要目标本身也可能不可微。可以使用强化学习直接优化这一目标。同策略 GKD 仅需要学生模型生成的输出样本，因此能够方便地与基于人类反馈（RLHF）或人工智能反馈（RLAIF）的强化学习微调相结合。具体而言，若希望针对标量奖励</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F72cb3a229067770aeb6caa625a65a1a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ODTke%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4d3c06c5" id="u4d3c06c5">优化学生策略，同时使其保持接近教师策略，则可得到以下带有正则项的强化学习微调目标</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud1be2e64" id="ud1be2e64" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%20X%7D%5Cn%5C%5CBigg%5B%5Cn%26%5Cn(1-%5C%5Calpha)%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7By%5C%5Csim%20p_S%5E%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5Br(y)%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7B%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Calpha%5Cn%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7By%5C%5Csim%20p_S(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5CnD%5C%5Cleft(p_T%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7Cp_S%5E%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cright)(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7B%E5%B9%BF%E4%B9%89%E5%90%8C%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%E8%92%B8%E9%A6%8F%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5CBigg%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5270d06dfdf82be8e3ab8d3678eeb740.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rYXsl%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u32cea4e1"><li fid="u1b4ca755" data-lake-id="u3710a613" id="u3710a613"><span data-lake-id="uff7ace76" id="uff7ace76">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6dfcad94b0b6ee21b88cdb1b516af7b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WfN4y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u72d0c6fc" id="u72d0c6fc"> 控制蒸馏损失相对于强化学习目标的强度。当 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc826cc2c698eb652b2325c109ef24de5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22evSsU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uba374cfb" id="uba374cfb"> 时，仅进行蒸馏。上述目标能够在最大化奖励的同时，通过蒸馏提升模型的其他能力，从而有可能减轻对齐税，即语言模型在人类偏好对齐过程中出现的通用能力下降。在 RLHF 或 RLAIF 中，通常使用反向 KL 约束学习得到的策略，使其保持接近初始策略</span></li></ul>